    "source_clause": "s.149",
    "source_page": 106,
    "source_text": "A DCP requirement/standard/control for residential apartment development has NO EFFECT if the ADG also specifies one on the same matter, regardless of when the DCP was made. The 8 matters: visual privacy, solar and daylight access, common circulation and spaces, apartment size and layout, ceiling heights, private open space and balconies, natural ventilation, storage. This legally resolves the discrepancy between this app's adg_balcony_min_area/adg_ground_floor_pos_min_area (ADG-sourced) and private_open_space/private_open_space_min_dimension (DCP Part F/G-sourced) \u2014 the ADG figures govern.",
